  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "(nods \u201cyes\u201d) mm huh.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Then what happens?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He told me to grab her feet and we took her outside.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Is she still alive?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "No, she was unconscious er",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "OK, OK, you got her tied up, she's, when you're getting her tied up, is she, is she alive or has he choked her already?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He choked her already.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Did he choke her when she had the handcuffs on?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "OK.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "When did he stab her?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "When, before he choked her.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Are you sure about that? (Brendan nods \u201cyes\u201d)",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "So she's laying there, handcuffs on, and that's when Steve stabs her?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "mm huh. (nods \u201cyes\u201d)",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "And then, then he chokes her after that?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Are you sure? (Brendan nods \u201cyes\u201d)",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Where exactly did he stab her again?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "In the stomach.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
